{"version":1,"content":"<p>名媛林恬兒（Emily）與何柱國兒子何正德結婚近12年，並育有一對子女。</p><p>惟今年8月中，何正德被拍到在加拿大街頭與一名任職保險經紀的新歡Janelle當街親熱，傳出二人已低調辦妥離婚手續。</p><p>近日，再爆出林恬兒雲端的私人合照遭盜用流出的事件。</p><p>雙方</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:24:02.169156+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:34:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.840025+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.840025+00:00","content_hash":"96308071d0200324e8153983272620c1f644ac6d41f2c374b94ea7b0f749324d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}